OL,3,GNEWSASection of King Charles III path
OL,4,Adamaged by storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the world's longest
OL,7,Fcoastal path has been washed away by
OL,8,Frecent storms.
OL,10,FThe King Charles III path, which
OL,11,Fstretches around the English coast, was
OL,12,Finaugurated by the king in March and
OL,13,Faccording to Natural England is the
OL,14,Flongest managed coastal walking route
OL,15,Fin the world.
OL,17,FStorm Austen and Boelo battered the
OL,18,Fcountry at the end of October, leaving
OL,19,Fdamage in their wake, including a
OL,20,Fsection of the footpath between the
OL,21,Fshore and the railway station at
OL,22,FFlimby, Cumbria.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
