OL,3,GNEWSASection of King Charles III path
OL,4,Adamaged by storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FCumberland council, which is
OL,7,Fresponsible for maintaining the path,
OL,8,Fsaid work would start soon to clear
OL,9,Fmore vegetation from the bank
OL,10,F"re-establishing a clear walking
OL,11,Fcorridor" along a 2,300ft (700 metres)
OL,12,Fsection.
